350
00:25:05,979 --> 00:25:07,356
Let's go, let's go!

351
00:25:09,525 --> 00:25:10,692
Karin!

352
00:25:10,776 --> 00:25:12,152
- Karin!
- Yeah.

353
00:25:13,403 --> 00:25:14,696
Go through the door!

354
00:25:17,533 --> 00:25:18,700
Gerry?

355
00:25:56,238 --> 00:25:58,157
